  m_Text: In ancient deserts, snow-covered lands, and pirate-occupied islands, countless
    treasures are hidden. Players will take on the role of a brave adventurer, traversing
    three different scenes within a set time, defeating enemies and powerful bosses
    to compete for the treasure. Each scene has different environments and challenges,
    and players need to skillfully use their controls and tactics to survive and
    defeat enemies, ultimately overcoming the bosses to open the treasure chests
    and obtain valuable rewards.
